{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06748","headline":"留别伊阙张少府郭大都尉 · 王昌龄","name":"留别伊阙张少府郭大都尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迁客就一醉，主人空金罍。\n江湖青山底，欲去仍裴回。\n郭侯未相识，策马伊川来。\n把手相劝勉，不应老尘埃。\n孟阳逢山旧，仙馆留清才。\n日晚劝趣别，风长云逐开。\n幸随板舆远，负谴何忧哉。\n唯有仗忠信，音书报云雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}